There are many different ways to potentially earn extra money quickly. Here are ten possible methods:  
1. Selling items you no longer need;  
2. Participating in paid surveys online;  
3. Starting an e-commerce business;  
4. Renting out your parking space;  
5. Running errands for others for payment;  
6. Tutoring or teaching subjects like math or science;  
7. Delivering food;  
8. Mowing lawns and landscaping;  
9. Babysitting;  
10. Providing virtual administrative support.
